  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the density of bob is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi></math> &amp; density of liquid is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> .<br />Now, Net downward force on bob = Weight - Buoyancy<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math><br />Net effective gravitational acceleration <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math><br />Time period <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mrow><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&#8729;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
